<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 15 million American-style call warrants, on CS Group shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    220 CHF		   PREMIUM	25.38 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.35 CHF		  GEARING	7.3 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 08.AUG.97-19.MAR.99   PAYDATE	07.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  197 CHF</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
